 the clock tower you'll see  a cutscene of the two trying to spot  Sam's tower when the cutscene ends do  yourself a favor and do nothing at all  seriously don't even touch the  controller stand still long enough and  you'll eventually unlock the stagefright  trophy in case this makes no sense to  you the reference is from the infamous  Uncharted 4 demo at e3 in 2015 when  exactly this happened  Nate was left standing there awkwardly  and the team had to restart the demo to  get it working awkward as hell but also  how cool is it that they can make fun of  themselves I respect that here's  something else to keep an eye out for  when you jump in a truck later in the  chapter if you take a closer look at the  license plate you'll see it reads VN 373  turn  upside down and look what you've got  Elena the name of Nate's wife cool touch  anyway how about something slightly  different to wrap this video up  throughout Nate's journey Naughty Dog  also managed to slip in a number of  other cultural references anyone who's  been online in the multiplayer portion  of Uncharted 4 will have noticed these  right away there are references to shows  like Breaking Bad in the form of Sully  scientists get up and even a few  pop-culture references to like Drake  doing that annoying hotline bling dance  I don't miss that in the slightest  however the clear winner amongst all  these references are a few nods to  uncharted z-- biggest inspiration  Indiana Jones while salmon Nate are  searching for gravestones in Scotland no  less Nate says this when he inspects an  incorrect date bad dates it's a  reference to Raiders of the Lost Ark  after indeed narrowly avoids eating some  poisoned dates himself birth dates oh  and also Nate can't help himself but use  one of Indies most famous lines when  fighting Nadine but you know all the  artifacts here are stolen they belong in  a museum honor amongst thieves I guess  so that's about it for uncharted 4  Easter eggs I feel like we should have  made this in 2016 but this was damn fun  to do in 2020 I do hope you enjoyed this  if you ever play this game again  remember you can jump into the bonus  menu after you've finished the game and  you can look at different ways to render  out the game's visuals switch it up  there's even one which is cel-shaded  which looks like Borderlands there's  another one where all the enemies are  bright red like super hot anyway I'll  keep talking if I don't shut up very  soon so I'll get out your way it's been  a pleasure I hope you enjoyed this I'm  Adam from PlayStation granade do the  like thing do the SUBSCRIBE thing and  I'll see you next time

